{"1782480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tormentis", "steam_appid": 1782480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782480/extras/46f409d80b16b2d8694cff8ab8fcfbae.avif?t=1786499297\" width=1260 height=160 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tormentis</strong> is an action RPG that combines fast, loot-driven combat with the strategic construction of your own castle.<br><br>Build deadly defenses filled with traps, guardians, and clever room structures – and raid the castles of other players to claim valuable loot and secure your place in the seasonal leaderboard.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782480/extras/f498d37eaf5ac0d0d129c720b0dffc89.avif?t=1786499297\" width=1260 height=160 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own castle with individually placeable rooms, enemies, and traps. Strengthen your defenses to bring attackers to their knees – and secure resources and rewards in the process.<br><br>But be warned: your castle never rests. Other players will attempt to break through your defenses and steal your treasures. Only those who build cleverly, place strategically, and use their resources wisely will prevail as rulers of their castle.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782480/extras/b13cb32e8cf70773502dd8617bf602f1.avif?t=1786499297\" width=1260 height=160 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scour other players’ castles in action-packed battles from an isometric perspective. Dodge deadly traps, defeat their defenders, and claim their most valuable treasures.<br><br>With quick reflexes, smart tactics, and the right gear, you will survive your opponents’ defenses. Those who master the dangers will seize valuable resources and rare materials to continuously improve their equipment.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782480/extras/b11340ec235c75b73f4e383f7f509082.avif?t=1786499297\" width=1260 height=160 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plunder high-quality gear, enhance it with targeted use of resources and a touch of luck. Use the auction house or trade directly with other players to create your ideal build.<br><br>Experiment with different combinations of weapons, armor, and skills to perfect your playstyle. Every decision brings you closer to your ultimate build!</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782480/extras/1382ba0d4097cc36622667b3bf4b5d5c.avif?t=1786499297\" width=1260 height=160 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every successful raid earns you trophies that improve your rank in the league. At the end of the season, exclusive rewards await the most successful players – defend your position or strike back!<br><br>Climb the ranks to compete with the best players. Each season brings new opportunities to place your name at the top of the league – and leave your rivals in awe of your castle and your strength.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782480/extras/9c5c2448b7f5de1fb91f5858b60205fe.avif?t=1786499297\" width=1260 height=160 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Castle building with strategic depth</li><li>Action-packed battles in classic ARPG style</li><li>A wide variety of traps, monsters, and rooms</li><li>Loot system with legendary items</li><li>Item trading via auction house and direct exchange</li><li>Seasonal leaderboard with exclusive rewards</li><li>Adventure Mode to create countless castles and share them with other players</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782480/extras/46f409d80b16b2d8694cff8ab8fcfbae.avif?t=1786499297\" width=1260 height=160 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tormentis</strong> is an action RPG that combines fast, loot-driven combat with the strategic construction of your own castle.<br><br>Build deadly defenses filled with traps, guardians, and clever room structures – and raid the castles of other players to claim valuable loot and secure your place in the seasonal leaderboard.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782480/extras/f498d37eaf5ac0d0d129c720b0dffc89.avif?t=1786499297\" width=1260 height=160 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own castle with individually placeable rooms, enemies, and traps. Strengthen your defenses to bring attackers to their knees – and secure resources and rewards in the process.<br><br>But be warned: your castle never rests. Other players will attempt to break through your defenses and steal your treasures. Only those who build cleverly, place strategically, and use their resources wisely will prevail as rulers of their castle.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782480/extras/b13cb32e8cf70773502dd8617bf602f1.avif?t=1786499297\" width=1260 height=160 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scour other players’ castles in action-packed battles from an isometric perspective. Dodge deadly traps, defeat their defenders, and claim their most valuable treasures.<br><br>With quick reflexes, smart tactics, and the right gear, you will survive your opponents’ defenses. Those who master the dangers will seize valuable resources and rare materials to continuously improve their equipment.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782480/extras/b11340ec235c75b73f4e383f7f509082.avif?t=1786499297\" width=1260 height=160 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plunder high-quality gear, enhance it with targeted use of resources and a touch of luck. Use the auction house or trade directly with other players to create your ideal build.<br><br>Experiment with different combinations of weapons, armor, and skills to perfect your playstyle. Every decision brings you closer to your ultimate build!</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782480/extras/1382ba0d4097cc36622667b3bf4b5d5c.avif?t=1786499297\" width=1260 height=160 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every successful raid earns you trophies that improve your rank in the league. At the end of the season, exclusive rewards await the most successful players – defend your position or strike back!<br><br>Climb the ranks to compete with the best players. Each season brings new opportunities to place your name at the top of the league – and leave your rivals in awe of your castle and your strength.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782480/extras/9c5c2448b7f5de1fb91f5858b60205fe.avif?t=1786499297\" width=1260 height=160 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Castle building with strategic depth</li><li>Action-packed battles in classic ARPG style</li><li>A wide variety of traps, monsters, and rooms</li><li>Loot system with legendary items</li><li>Item trading via auction house and direct exchange</li><li>Seasonal leaderboard with exclusive rewards</li><li>Adventure Mode to create countless castles and share them with other players</li></ul>", "short_description": "Build deadly castles, survive fast-paced action RPG combat, and hunt for legendary loot. Raid rivals, crush intruders, and fight your way up the seasonal leaderboard to claim the crown. Outsmart, outfight, and outlast every challenger!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Finnish<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Norwegian<strong>*</strong>, Swedish<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782480/header.jpg?t=1786499297", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782480/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786499297", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782480/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786499297", "website": "https://www.tormentis.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 2.6 GHz / AMD Ryzen 3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 / AMD HD 7950<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 2.7 GHz / AMD Ryzen 5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1070 / AMD Radeon Vega 56<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Netw